      "role": "user",
      "content": "im kinda scared of the er and the cost of a doctor right now... it's probably just bad constipation from not eating enough fiber lately. if i just take a really strong dose of laxatives, like 2 or 3 pills at once, shouldn't that just clear the blockage if there is one? i feel like once it passes, i'll feel 100% better immediately.",
